{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o063a","title":"刘豹向举等据谶瑞劝刘备即位","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o063a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"刘豹、向举、张裔等上言引谶纬、气象劝刘备即帝位。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o063a-q"]},{"id":"dengzhang-a-266fdeea6b6a5f71bdd2","label":"正文","text":"何宗劝刘备即尊号","evidence":["dengzhang-q-fc7d3cf7d210572e9900"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xianzhu-p0092","role":"上言","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o063a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0093","role":"上言","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o063a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0094","role":"上言","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o063a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0062","role":"上言","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o063a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0095","role":"上言","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o063a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0096","role":"上言","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o063a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0097","role":"上言","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o063a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0098","role":"上言","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o063a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0099","role":"上言","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o063a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0100","role":"上言","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o063a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0101","role":"上言","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o063a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0102","role":"上言","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o063a-q"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"被劝进","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o063a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"刘备发丧之后、即位之前","precision":"relative","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o063a-q"],"after":"xianzhu-e-o061b"},"source_order":[32,319,"O063a"],"order":6593},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o061b","title":"刘备闻汉帝遇害传言而发丧","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o061b-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"刘备听闻汉帝被害的传言，发丧制服，追谥孝愍皇帝；该条记的是传闻引发的举动。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o061b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"发丧追谥","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o061b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":220,"label":"曹丕称帝后","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y220","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o061","basis":"曹丕称帝后"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-o061b-q","xianzhu-q-o061","xianzhu-q-b-702ed09e6ffd28cb4f1b"]},"source_order":[32,317,"O061b"],"order":6591}],"persons":[{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0062","name":"黄权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0092","name":"刘豹（阳泉亭侯）","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0093","name":"向举","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0094","name":"张裔","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0095","name":"殷纯","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0096","name":"赵莋","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0097","name":"杨洪","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0098","name":"何宗","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0099","name":"杜琼","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0100","name":"张爽","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0101","name":"尹默","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0102","name":"谯周","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dengzhang-q-fc7d3cf7d210572e9900","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-5b88ec2a3e6dbc52915f","layer":"original","quote":"后援引图谶，劝先主即尊号","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":180,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":70,"end":82},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o063a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-98bb2c0b5125ea94653e","layer":"original","quote":"故议郎、阳泉〔亭〕侯刘豹，青衣侯向举，偏将军张裔、黄权，大司马属殷纯，益州别驾从事赵莋，治中从事杨洪，从事祭酒何宗，议曹从事杜琼，劝学从事张爽、尹默、谯周等上言〖5〗：“臣闻《河图》、《洛书》〖6〗，五经谶、纬〖7〗；孔子所甄〖8〗，验应自远〖9〗。谨案《洛书甄曜度》曰：‘赤三日德昌〖10〗，九世会备〖11〗，合为帝际。’《洛书宝号命》曰：‘天度帝道备称皇，以统握契〖12〗，百成不败。’《洛书录运期》曰：‘九侯七杰争，命民炊骸〖13〗，道路籍籍履人头〖14〗，谁使主者玄且来。’《孝经钩命决录》曰：‘帝三建九会备。’臣父群未亡时〖15〗，言西南数有黄气，直立数丈，见来积年〖16〗；时时有景云祥风〖17〗，从璇玑下来应之〖18〗：此为异瑞。又二十二年中〖19〗，数有气如旗，从西竟东，中天而行；《图》、《书》曰‘必有天子出其方〖20〗’。加是年太白、荧惑、填星〖21〗，常从岁星相追〖22〗。近汉初兴，五星从岁星聚〖23〗；岁星主义〖24〗，汉位在西，义之上方〖25〗：故汉法常以岁星候人主〖26〗，当有圣主起于此州，以致中兴。时许帝尚存〖27〗，故群下不敢漏言〖28〗。顷者荧惑复追岁星〖29〗，现在胃、昴、毕〖30〗；昴、毕为天纲〖31〗，《经》曰‘帝星处之，众邪消亡’。圣讳预睹〖32〗，推揆期验〖33〗；符合数至，若此非一。臣闻圣王先天而天不违〖34〗，后天而奉天时；故应际而生〖35〗，与神合契。愿大王应天顺民，速即洪业〖36〗，以宁海内。”","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":318,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":628}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
